+guamp: partial updates. A pass's loaded color attachment over a shadowed buffer or surface texture, whose draws' scissors bound
+what it draws (clear_reach::DrawnArea) and which nothing else of the pass uses, is copied in only inside that bound (ShadowUse::loads),
+as it was already copied back only there: a render server redrawing a damaged rectangle of its framebuffer (Load + scissor) copies that
+rectangle, not the frame, both ways. Counters (WorkCounts): texels copied in and of the whole images; passes ended, colour 0 loaded or
+cleared, passes whose draws' scissors bound them with the bound's and render area's pixels.
